PRIMABELLE forms a larger number of tubers (there will be about 15-16 pieces per bush), compared to COLOMBO. But the marketability (the number of tubers with a diameter of 45+ mm and more) is lower for PRIMABELLE.
We would like to separately emphasize the advantages of PRIMABELLE, which make us talk about this variety as one of the potential leaders.
