The company began its activity in 2012, at the start, the planting area was no more than 200 hectares of marketable potatoes.
At the moment, the structure of sown areas includes more than a thousand hectares of seed potatoes, over three thousand leguminous crops, as well as a crop rotation for the fodder base.
LLC Aksentis has a powerful research and production base to ensure the full cycle of seed production. The primary seed production system includes a micro-propagation laboratory equipped with the most modern equipment and a high-tech greenhouse complex, which allows to obtain up to 650 minitubers per year.
In addition to the developed integrated technology for the cultivation of seed potatoes, which includes crop rotation, soil cultivation, fertilization and plant protection systems, the most modern examples of the world's agricultural machinery, including the brands John Deere, Grimme, Lemken and others, help in the implementation of ambitious plans. The basis for obtaining high quality products, as well as productivity, is a high production culture, which includes a number of important aspects.
The priority aspect is working with the main resource of the company - personnel. We create and develop a team of professionals and like-minded people.
In addition to our own interests, our company also takes into account the business interests of our partners and clients, since favorable and successful cooperation is the basis of mutually beneficial relations, and openness and honesty are the principle for long-term joint projects.
