Landing is getting closer, in farms - full combat readiness. With what mood do potato growers meet the season?
– CJSC Oktyabrskoye is one of the oldest farms in the Leningrad Region, has been engaged in potato seed production for more than a century. Our laboratory produces seed material of about 40 varieties of potatoes of domestic and foreign selection.
We paid for the supply of a self-propelled sprayer and imported tractors, but the supplier returned the money, there will be no deliveries in the near future. Well, we will switch to domestically produced tractors - RSM Rostselmash.
The drug is used for desiccation of potato tops before harvesting, partial destruction of weeds, and on rapeseed and cereals, in the conditions of the northwestern region - for drying the pod and ear. We managed to buy it for potatoes, but it may not be enough for rapeseed.
The main difficulty is that snow lay on the fields of the Leningrad Region until mid-April. The sowing campaign has shifted, and it is not clear when it will begin.
does not increase crop area. We allocate 140 ha for potatoes, 20 ha for cabbage, 16 ha for beets and 3 ha for carrots.
In the Novgorod region, four peasant farms, including ours, have the status of seed farms specializing in the cultivation of high potato reproductions. Therefore, we have no difficulties with seed material: we grow from test tubes for ourselves those varieties that are of interest to us.
The situation with plant protection products today is such that even if the farm has the money and the desire to work with a specific imported drug, manufacturers cannot ensure its supply, many positions are in short supply. Other peasant farms in our region are experiencing great difficulties in this regard.
What will happen in the future?
In our economy, great efforts are directed to the development, strengthening of the material and technical base, and the modernization of production. Preparing for this season, we ordered two foreign-made tractors, paid for them, but it is still not clear when we will receive them and whether we will receive them at all.
We do not hope for forecasts, we will work in the circumstances that will develop.
turns 30 years old. We congratulate the head of the farm Ivan Ivanovich Geletey and all the employees of the enterprise on their anniversary and wish them a successful season!
There are problems: chemistry, machinery, spare parts - everything has risen in price by about 20-30%. Our costs in preparation for the season, respectively, increased by the same amount.
Over the years, the farm has been modernized, new technologies have been introduced (in particular, a navigation system). Unfortunately, we are reducing the area under potatoes by 40 percent this year.
A lot of problems are expected in the new season.
Significantly increased the cost of mineral fertilizers and chemical means of protection. Since we purchased protective equipment before the new year, plus we still have stocks from the 2021 season, our peasant farm will not have any inconvenience with chemistry this season.
