Properties of stainless steel The stainless steel has a bright grayish or silver-white appearance.Close structure, not easy to oxidize iron oxide, so it is called rust.Stainless steel is the general name of alloy steel which can resist the etching action of acid, alkali and salt.In the alloy to chromium, some also add nickel, molybdenum, titanium and other elements, in order to improve the corrosion resistance.
The color stainless steel tinted film has good adhesion to the stainless steel matrix and has good wear resistance and characterization resistance.The coloring film can withstand the rubber friction load of 500g more than 200 times, and can withstand the load of 120g steel needle characterization.
Because color stainless steel has a series of characteristics such as bright color, ultraviolet radiation resistance, no discoloration, film not brittle crack, good processing performance, etc., it is not only an important material in industry, but also a rare plate in the nameplate process with wide decorative, strong corrosion resistance and high mechanical strength of finished products.
