2) as the product belongs to the type of single variety and large batch, it is recommended to choose the ingot rapid heating furnace, and it is better to make the ingot temperature gradient.
First of all, the deformation of the ingot port cut by the current long ingot hot shearing machine is large, which affects the subsequent peeling effect and easily causes the ingot skin to flow into the extrusion product.
Third, the ingot is heated rapidly, which is beneficial to maintain the state after the ingot is homogenized;Fourth, gradient heating of the ingot (the temperature at the front end of the ingot is about 500℃, and the temperature at the end is about 460℃), which is conducive to reducing the formation of the shrinking tail of the extrusion product and the consistency of the mechanical properties of the product.
4) quenching treatment
After the test, the best plan is the first 4-5 meters with wind fog mixture cooling, the product temperature to 250 degrees, and then 1-2 meters spray.Of course, spray layout to pay attention to, must be the product circumference of each point uniform cooling.After the quenching, the product temperature drops to about 100℃.If add a section of air cooling (4 meters is better), the effect is even better.
