Points for attention when CNC machining precision parts:
Before the mechanical action, check whether the moving part is filled with lubricating oil, then start and check whether the clutch and brake are normal, and run the machine empty for 1-3 minutes. It is strictly prohibited to operate when the machine is in trouble.
When starting the power to start the machine, the machine can only be started after all other personnel leave the machine work area and take away the sundries on the work table.
When replacing the mold, first turn off the power, and only after the punch movement department stops operation, can the installation and debugging of the mold begin.After the installation and adjustment, the flywheel should be moved by hand to test the impact twice. In order to avoid unnecessary collision between the machine and the products to be processed, the upper and lower molds must be checked for symmetry, reasonability, firmness of screws, and reasonability of the blanking ring.
