How to achieve laser cutting machine focusing, 50% of users do not know!
When laser cutting machine cuts different materials and different thicknesses of plates, in order to achieve better cutting results, the focus of the laser beam will be set in different places, that is, focusing. So, how can we make the laser cutting machine focus to achieve a good cutting effect?
At the same time, the position of the laser beam passing through the exit of the cutting nozzle also affects the processing quality of the laser. The optimal position of the central axis of the laser beam should be at the center of the exit of the cutting nozzle.
Automatic focusing can be achieved by using a motor-driven focusing mirror for up and down motion. Another method of autofocusing is to set a tunable mirror before the beam enters the focusing mirror, and change the divergence angle of the reflected beam by changing the curvature of the mirror to change the focus position.
