High precision of fiber laser cutting machine: The fiber laser cutting machine adopts laser operation, which can achieve high-density directional emission of energy, making its cutting path small and high precision. And it adopts “non-contact processing”, which will not squeeze the material, so that the cut is not deformed, and it is smooth and burr-free.
1. Properly increasing the speed of the laser cutting machine can not only improve the quality of the slit, but also the slit is narrow and flat, and can also reduce the deformation of the slit.
If the cutting speed is too fast, the line energy of the cutting will be lower than the required value. During the slitting process, the blown air cannot quickly blow off the molten material, which will form a large amount of back drag, which will affect the cutting performance.
If the speed of the laser cutting machine is too low, the cutting part will be exposed to the laser high temperature for a long time, which will not only cause the cutting seam to become larger, but also may affect the aesthetics of the cutting seam due to too much heat conduction. The phenomenon of dross forming on the back of the metal.
When the speed is extremely low, the incision will melt too much and the incision will be wider, even causing the arc to go out and the situation that cannot be cut occurs.
