The centrifugal fan has good ventilation effect, and is especially suitable for use in pipeline ventilation or air supply.
Centrifugal fans are usually used to transport air in pipelines, and can be used in places without corrosion, flammable and explosive gases.
The impeller of the centrifugal fan is reasonably designed to be backward inclined, with no friction during operation, very low noise and not easy to get dust, and maintenance is very convenient.
