Odessa is the 3rd largest city in Ukraine, the most important city for trade and the 2nd most popular city for tourism in Ukraine.It is the largest city along the entire Black Sea.
In addition to the importance of the seaport, the city’s industries include ship building, oil refining, chemicals, metal working and food processing.
