③ When the surface roughness value of the workpiece is Ra=0.8～3.2μm, it should be divided into three steps: rough milling, semi-finishing milling and finishing milling. For semi-finish milling, the amount of back-grabbing or side-grabbing is 1.5-2mm; for finishing milling, the side-grabbing amount is 0.3-0.5mm, and the back-grabbing amount of the face milling cutter is 0.5-1mm.
