2 cups (250grams) rice + 16 tablespoons cooked fish + 1 cup cooked green vegetables plus add an extra 1 ½ tablespoons of oil while cooking to increase the energy content
Thick enriched bobor/ mashed foods and foods that baby can pick up
Continued breastfeeds on the demand at least 3x/day or 1-2 cups of any kind of milk
